step The Undercroft
  tip Ride south-west to the Undercroft. The mound of dirt lies inside. Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised.
  tip Careful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot.
